            ("Home linen, curtains and carpets", "<p>A bed sheet is AED 20, a duvet AED 60 and a duvet cover AED 40. Curtains are priced per square metre: chiffon from AED 12, standard from AED 15 and blackout from AED 20, with lower rates when cleaned at your home. Carpets start at AED 30 per square metre and on-site sofa shampooing is AED 70 per seat.</p>"),
